# @name: jq | Filter by Multiple Conditions
# @description: Filters array elements by multiple conditions Group: JQ Filtering and Selection. Template: replace placeholders before running. {field1} = First field name | {value1} = First field value | {field2} = Second field name | {operator} = Comparison operator [default ">"] | {value2} = Second field value [default "0"] | {json_file} = Path to JSON file or '-' for stdin
jq '.[] | select(.{field1} == "{value1}" and .{field2} {operator} {value2})' {json_file}